Here's a suggestion:

We've got blindness in Nethack, how about deafness?  With 3.1, it
might actually have a few effects on the game:

	o Can't hear "random noises" in the dungeon
	o Can't #chat with monsters, or hear them murmuring in your ear,
	  demanding money for "safe passage", etc.
	o Can't play musical instruments
	o Can't use a stethoscope
	o Can't cast certain spells that have "verbal components"
	  (you can't hear what you're saying), and so on.

Things that could cause it:

	o Explosions (say, from a fireball or a land mine or a trapped chest)
	o Shriekers
	o Cursed helmets called "earmuffs"
	o Earplugs (which would also protect you from hearing loss)
	o etc.

Ways to cure it:

	o Potions healing/extra healing/restore ability
	o #praying
	o time

What do you think?  Would this actually add something to the game,
or is it just YASI?

Carl


